    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write my weekly performance digest from {{ $json.start_date }} to {{ $json.end_date }}.\nLanguage: {{ $json.language }}\nBrand voice: {{ $json.brand_voice }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You write a weekly performance digest for social media accounts managed in SocialRobot.\n\nSteps:\n1. Call list_connected_accounts.\n2. For every Instagram, Facebook, Threads, LinkedIn, Pinterest or TikTok account, call get_posts_with_analytics with its accountId and platform, the startDate and endDate from the request, and limit 20. Call get_account_analytics for the same dates when account totals help.\n3. SocialRobot has no analytics for X, Bluesky or Mastodon. Say those accounts were skipped.\n\nRules:\n- Only use numbers returned by the tools. Never estimate or invent metrics. If a tool returns no data, say so.\n- digest_markdown: under 250 words. Headline numbers per network, the top 3 posts with one line on why each worked, and 3 concrete recommendations for next week.\n- drafts: 3 to 5 new posts that reuse the angle of the best performers. Each has a platform (bluesky, mastodon, threads, facebook or x) and text under 280 characters, in the requested language and voice. No links you were not given.",
          "maxIterations": 30
        }
      },
      "id": "8b6cd30d-6698-4405-b022-27f40932ddc6",
      "name": "Analyze Performance Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1008,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
